  "eventHelpDinoRow": "The row where the dinosaur appears, counted from 0. On Underwater World lawns, this can be set to 5 for the sixth row.",
  "eventHelpDinoWaveDuration": "The number of waves a dinosaur remains on the lawn. The dinosaur will leave after staying for the specified number of waves or after interacting with a certain number of zombies. When set to 0, there is no wave limit, and the dinosaur will leave after completing its interactions by default.",
