  "moduleHelpDeathHoleBody": "When a plant is shoveled, eaten, or otherwise removed, it leaves an unplantable crater on the tile it occupied for a period of time.",
  "moduleHelpZombieMoveFastBody": "Makes zombies move quickly as they enter the lawn, returning to normal speed after they reach the specified column. Commonly used in the Zombie Elimination Initiative levels.",
  "moduleHelpSeedRainBody": "At fixed intervals, this module causes item cards to fall from the sky.",
  "moduleHelpSeedRainParameters": "Parameter settings",
  "moduleHelpSeedRainParametersBody": "Weight determines an item's chance of dropping, while Max count limits how many copies may be present on the lawn at once. Note that most zombies do not have matching zombie card icons.",
  "moduleHelpSeedRainPlantLevels": "Plant levels",
  "seedRainAddContentTitle": "Add rain content",
  "moduleHelpRailcartBody": "Configure the positions of minecarts and rails and select the minecart style. Tap a tile once to place an item, and tap it again to remove it.",
  "moduleHelpRailcartRailsBody": "In Lay rails mode, tap tiles to lay rails. The editor automatically combines consecutive tiles in the same column into a single rail segment.",
  "moduleHelpRailcartCartsBody": "Tap tiles to place or remove minecarts. Note that minecarts on the same rail segment can easily stack.",
  "moduleHelpTideBody": "Enables the tide system for the level, allowing tide-related events to be used. Note that this module must be added last; otherwise, it may cause the level to crash.",
  "moduleHelpTidePosition": "Sets the position of the tide at the start of the level, i.e., the position of the tide line within the level. The rightmost column is 0 and the leftmost is 9. Accepts integers, including negative values.",
  "initialTidePosition": "Tide line configuration",
  "moduleHelpWeatherBody": "Controls global environmental effects such as rain and snow.",
  "moduleHelpWeatherRef": "These modules are typically referenced directly from LevelModules and do not require custom configuration.",
  "moduleHelpZombiePotionBody": "This module periodically spawns specified grid item types in random rows, moving from right to left.",
  "moduleHelpZombiePotionMechanism": "Spawn Mechanism",
  "moduleHelpZombiePotionMechanismBody": "Grid items spawn randomly within the configured time interval. If the number of matching grid items on the lawn reaches the limit, spawning pauses.",
  "moduleHelpZombiePotionPotionTypes": "Potion Types",
  "moduleHelpZombiePotionTypes": "One type is randomly selected from the configured list. To spawn multiple grid items at fixed intervals, add this module multiple times in the level.",
  "moduleHelpUnknownBody": "A level file consists of a root node and multiple modules, known as PVZ2Object. Each object has aliases, a type (objclass), and data (objdata). The root node has no aliases.",
  "moduleHelpUnknownEvents": "This software determines module types by reading objclass. The objclass of the current module is not registered in the module list, so no matching editor is available. Support may be added in a future update.",
  "eventHelpInvalidBody": "This event is referenced in the wave container, but the parser cannot find its entity definition in the level, leaving the RTID block unresolved.",
  "eventHelpInvalidImpact": "Keeping this invalid entry in the level will prevent it from being read correctly and may cause a crash. It should be removed manually.",
