  "manholePipelineHelpTitle": "Manhole Pipeline",
  "manholePipelineHelpOverview": "Defines an underground pipe system. Commonly used in Steam Ages levels. Pipes connect two sewers, allowing zombies to travel between them.",
  "manholePipelineHelpEditing": "Select a pipe group from the list above. The grid below shows the layout. Use \"Set Start\" or \"Set End\", then tap a tile to place it.",
  "smokePollutionModuleHelpTitle": "Steam Manhole module",
  "smokePollutionModuleHelpOverview": "Overview",
  "smokePollutionModuleHelpOverviewBody": "Pre-place covered sewer manholes on the lawn, commonly used in Steam Ages levels. After the specified time, toxic steam blasts the covers off and spreads across a 3×3 area centered on each manhole. Plants caught in the steam take 30 damage per second.",
  "smokePollutionModuleHelpManholes": "Usage",
  "smokePollutionModuleHelpManholesBody": "Select a tile, then tap \"+\" to place a sewer manhole. Each manhole can have its eruption time (StartTime) configured independently, determining how long after the level begins its cover is blasted off and toxic steam is released.",
