  "hamsterballHelpOverviewTitle": "Overview",
  "hamsterballHelpOverviewBody": "Introduced to the Chinese version in the 12th Anniversary Secret Realm, this ambush event summons rolling hamsterballs that carry zombies onto the lawn. Hamsterballs have three behavior modes, and plants run over along the way are destroyed immediately.\nHamsterballs have their own health. When broken, they release the zombies inside so they can continue advancing. Spikeweed, Spikerock, and similar plants can puncture hamsterballs and release their passengers.",
