  "airDropShipModuleHelpOverview": "Overview",
  "airDropShipModuleHelpOverviewBody": "This module is used to configure Transport Boats that appear during waves in a level, commonly seen in Sky City levels. Transport Boats cannot be damaged. A set number of Flying Imp Zombies will drop sequentially into the designated drop area.",
  "airDropShipModuleHelpImps": "Parameters",
