  "moduleTitle_HeianWindModuleProperties": "Heian Divine Wind",
  "moduleDesc_HeianWindModuleProperties": "Wind that pushes zombies and knocks plants into the air",
  "heianWindModuleHelpTitle": "Heian Divine Wind module",
  "heianWindModuleHelpOverview": "Overview",
  "heianWindModuleHelpOverviewBody": "This module is used to summon Divine Wind at specified waves, commonly seen in Heian Ages levels. The wind pushes a set number of small and medium zombies within its range horizontally. After all winds in a wave finish, rows affected by single-row winds will generate a whirlwind (one per row). The whirlwind carries zombies forward and knocks plants into the air on contact before disappearing.",
