  "armrackModuleHelpOverview": "Overview",
  "armrackModuleHelpOverviewBody": "Places weapon stands from Kongfu World at specified positions on the lawn. Kongfu Zombies and Monk Zombies that pass by a Weapon Stand will pick up the weapon on it, transform into the corresponding special zombie, and fully restore their health. The weapon stand will break and disappear either when its own health is depleted or when the weapon on it is picked up.\nThis module also ensures that Weapon Stands display correctly in both the editor and the game, preventing them from incorrectly appearing with a sun texture.",
