  "gladiatorPreviewTitle": "Gladiatorial Row area preview",
  "gladiatorPreviewLegend": "The green tile marks the trophy fixed in column 5; red tiles mark the rest of the arena. Zombie icons show cage spawn positions, and each tile’s number shows the zombie count. Tap the grid to select a row.",
