  "moduleTitle_OakTrainProperties": "Oak Archery",
  "moduleDesc_OakTrainProperties": "Uses Oak Archer's arrows to land headshots and earn points",
  "moduleHelpOakTrainOverviewBody": "A Dark Ages-exclusive minigame. An Oak Archer is placed in column 1, row 3. Control him and use three types of arrows to land headshots on targets and win. The game is lost if Oak Archer runs out of health or a zombie reaches the house.",
  "moduleHelpOakTrainScoresBody": "Defeating different zombie types awards different scores, which are converted into coins when the level is completed. Collecting these coins has no effect when the Creative Courtyard module is in use. This score is calculated separately from the score awarded for defeating zombies by the Level Scoring module and does not count toward score challenges.",
  "moduleHelpOakTrainArrowsBody": "Oak Archer can fire three types of arrows: normal arrows hit a single target, power arrows deal double damage in a small area, and scatter arrows fire seven individual shots in a spread. When normal arrows run out, 12 are automatically reloaded after 10 seconds. Other arrows are obtained by shooting the colored Power Spheres on the lawn. Scatter arrows can also be purchased with diamonds during the level.",
