  "goldRoadNonLostCityLawnWarningTitle": "Lawn appearance notice",
  "goldRoadNonLostCityLawnWarning": "Golden Road is a Lost City minigame module, so its unsodded areas feature the sun pattern specific to the Lost City lawn. Using it with other lawn appearances may affect the overall look of the level.",
  "goldRoadDeepseaLawnWarningTitle": "Lawn compatibility notice",
  "goldRoadDeepseaLawnWarning": "Golden Road only turns the first and fifth rows into unsodded areas. This also applies to six-row lawns with an Underwater World appearance, so keep this in mind when using the module.",
  "moduleHelpOakTrainZombiesBody": "The zombies designed for this module are dedicated variants with abilities that differ from their regular tower-defense counterparts. They appear through the Wave Generator with Rise from Ground enabled. Their abilities do not work in regular Wave Manager events such as Basic Spawner and Underwater Spawner. Use Ground Spawner or custom zombies to achieve similar effects.\nThe Power Spheres that supply arrows are also zombies internally. Their abilities depend on both Oak Archery and Rise from Ground; spawning them outside these conditions may cause missing textures or effects.",
